    <h2 id="age">2. Age restriction</h2>
    <p>You must be at least <strong>18 years old</strong> in the United Kingdom (or the local legal drinking age, if higher) to use this website or buy our products. By placing an order, you confirm that you and the recipient are of legal drinking age.</p>
