    <h2 id="delivery">5. Delivery</h2>
    <p>We deliver to UK mainland addresses via Royal Mail, DPD or Evri (we choose the most suitable carrier per order). Typical delivery time is <strong>2–5 working days</strong>. Orders over £30 qualify for free standard delivery; a flat fee applies below that threshold and is shown at checkout.</p>
    <p>Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, the Channel Islands and certain remote postcodes may attract a surcharge or longer transit time — this will be shown at checkout. We don't currently ship outside the UK.</p>
    <p>Risk in the products passes to you on delivery. Title passes once we've received payment in full. Where no one is available to receive an alcohol delivery, the courier may attempt redelivery, leave a card or hold the parcel for collection.</p>

    <h2 id="returns">6. Returns &amp; refunds</h2>
    <p>Under the Consumer Contracts (Information, Cancellation and Additional Charges) Regulations 2013 you have <strong>14 days</strong> from the date you receive your order to tell us you want to cancel, and a further 14 days to return the goods.</p>
    <p>For alcoholic products, cans must be returned <strong>unopened, undamaged and in their original packaging</strong> so they remain resaleable. Once we receive them in that condition we'll refund the price you paid (including standard outbound delivery, where the whole order is returned) within 14 days, using the same payment method you used to order.</p>
    <p>Return postage is your responsibility unless the goods are faulty or we sent the wrong item. We recommend using a tracked service.</p>
    <p>To start a return, email <a href="mailto:hola@sencillodrinks.com">hola@sencillodrinks.com</a> with your order number.</p>

